# Vehicle Hire Management System — public root rules
Options -Indexes
DirectoryIndex index.php

<IfModule mod_headers.c>
    Header set X-Content-Type-Options "nosniff"
    Header set X-Frame-Options "SAMEORIGIN"
    Header set Referrer-Policy "strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
</IfModule>

# Block hidden/dot files and sensitive file types
<FilesMatch "^\.|\.(sql|log|md|ini|sh|bak|old|dist)$">
    Require all denied
</FilesMatch>
